{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anokye</i>\u00a0is a 2D action\u2013adventure platformer that reimagines the birth of a legend. Step into the role of Anokye, chosen by destiny to unite the Ashanti people and bring light to a land shrouded in tyranny. When darkness falls on the Kingdom, one hero rises. Armed with a <strong>sword, staff, and sacred whisk broom</strong>, Anokye must battle through <strong>several stunning levels</strong>, from ancient villages and dense forests to high mountain peaks and mystical waterfalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment draws from <strong>authentic Ghanaian art, landscapes, and folklore</strong>, blending tradition with fast-paced modern gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/extras/164ccd1b108e73a30850a80237a3cf71.poster.avif?t=1767370859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/extras/164ccd1b108e73a30850a80237a3cf71.webm?t=1767370859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/extras/164ccd1b108e73a30850a80237a3cf71.mp4?t=1767370859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense 2D Action:</strong> Run, jump, dash, glide, and wall-jump your way through handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful African Worlds:</strong> Explore richly designed environments inspired by Ghanaian culture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Abilities:</strong> Master traditional weapons and unlock hidden powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Outsmart fierce enemies and conquer mythical beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Soundtrack:</strong> Feel the rhythm of Africa through original, culturally infused music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Courage:</strong> Discover a tale that celebrates unity, bravery, and destiny.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127540?t=1767370859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127540?t=1767370859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/489958d3644692d799835662ce5dfd0488ba7f92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767370859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/489958d3644692d799835662ce5dfd0488ba7f92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767370859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anokye</i>\u00a0is a 2D action\u2013adventure platformer that reimagines the birth of a legend. Step into the role of Anokye, chosen by destiny to unite the Ashanti people and bring light to a land shrouded in tyranny. When darkness falls on the Kingdom, one hero rises. Armed with a <strong>sword, staff, and sacred whisk broom</strong>, Anokye must battle through <strong>several stunning levels</strong>, from ancient villages and dense forests to high mountain peaks and mystical waterfalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment draws from <strong>authentic Ghanaian art, landscapes, and folklore</strong>, blending tradition with fast-paced modern gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/extras/164ccd1b108e73a30850a80237a3cf71.poster.avif?t=1767370859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/extras/164ccd1b108e73a30850a80237a3cf71.webm?t=1767370859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/extras/164ccd1b108e73a30850a80237a3cf71.mp4?t=1767370859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense 2D Action:</strong> Run, jump, dash, glide, and wall-jump your way through handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful African Worlds:</strong> Explore richly designed environments inspired by Ghanaian culture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Abilities:</strong> Master traditional weapons and unlock hidden powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Outsmart fierce enemies and conquer mythical beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Soundtrack:</strong> Feel the rhythm of Africa through original, culturally infused music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Courage:</strong> Discover a tale that celebrates unity, bravery, and destiny.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Mills Media"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127540/af691f7ba7e657ff485cc9ed08e9afdefe682b8e/header.jpg?t=1767370859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4127540/1418001392/74620642324cae41f3f1012136cd7c69ef4553f5/1761175152/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761788050","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/412